WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:02.340
- Please tell me that Dan
has styled you before,

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:04.123
and for TikTok, please.

00:00:04.123 --> 00:00:06.330
(Kelly laughing)
- No, he, he, he,

00:00:06.330 --> 00:00:07.800
not for TikTok.

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:08.694
- Not for TikTok,

00:00:08.694 --> 00:00:10.230
what was it for?
- He did style me once,

00:00:10.230 --> 00:00:14.040
a few years ago for some opening,

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:15.540
premiere, you know,

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:16.467
one of the things.
- He's got great taste.

00:00:16.467 --> 00:00:17.700
- And he did dress me.

00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:19.774
But, you know, (coughs)

00:00:19.774 --> 00:00:20.607
I was

00:00:20.607 --> 00:00:22.290
going out of town,

00:00:22.290 --> 00:00:24.510
I was waiting for the car
to take me to the airport.

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:26.880
And I, you know, I used
to put on a shirt and tie

00:00:26.880 --> 00:00:30.600
and jacket, you know,
jeans, that kind of thing.

00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:31.530
But I was into that.

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:34.260
He walks out one day, he was four,

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:36.900
and he looks at me standing,
waiting for the car.

00:00:36.900 --> 00:00:41.040
And he's looking at me and I
said, "What is it, Daniel?"

00:00:41.040 --> 00:00:41.873
He said,

00:00:44.167 --> 00:00:46.200
"From here up,

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:47.225
great."

00:00:47.225 --> 00:00:48.967
- (laughing)

00:00:48.967 --> 00:00:51.180
- "From here down, gross."

00:00:51.180 --> 00:00:53.100
- Gross.
(audience laughing)

00:00:53.100 --> 00:00:56.753
- I said, "You don't like
the jeans with the thing?"

00:00:56.753 --> 00:00:58.470
- (Gina laughing)

00:00:58.470 --> 00:00:59.560
- He was four.

00:00:59.560 --> 00:01:00.393
(audience laughing)
- My-

00:01:00.393 --> 00:01:02.760
- And he has the greatest
sense of style now.

00:01:02.760 --> 00:01:03.630
- [Kelly] He does.

00:01:03.630 --> 00:01:05.124
He does.
- Yes, he's a fashion icon.

00:01:05.124 --> 00:01:05.957
- Amazing.

00:01:05.957 --> 00:01:07.740
- My six and eight year
old will call, literally,

00:01:07.740 --> 00:01:08.573
we're going to dinner,

00:01:08.573 --> 00:01:10.920
my friend is in the building
hearing this right now,

00:01:10.920 --> 00:01:13.230
and we are about ready to
go and my son looked at me,

00:01:13.230 --> 00:01:14.269
he's six.

00:01:14.269 --> 00:01:15.150
(audience laughing)

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:15.983
And he looked at me and he goes,

00:01:15.983 --> 00:01:18.224
"So, are you gonna go get ready?"

00:01:18.224 --> 00:01:20.070
(Kelly and audience laughing)

00:01:20.070 --> 00:01:21.060
- Oh.

00:01:21.060 --> 00:01:21.907
- I was like,

00:01:21.907 --> 00:01:23.317
- [Gina] (laughing)

00:01:23.317 --> 00:01:25.895
- "Sorry, but I look
really good right now."

00:01:25.895 --> 00:01:26.960
I was like, "What?"
- [Gina] (laughing)

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:29.490
- I was like, I looked
really cute, Nirvana grunge,

00:01:29.490 --> 00:01:30.530
I thought I was pulling it off.

00:01:30.530 --> 00:01:31.710
- (chuckles)
- And, like,

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:33.060
I had literally come straight from work.

00:01:33.060 --> 00:01:34.770
And then my daughter
comes around the corner,

00:01:34.770 --> 00:01:37.800
not kidding, didn't even hear Remi say it,

00:01:37.800 --> 00:01:39.547
and River comes around the
corner and she was like,

00:01:39.547 --> 00:01:40.770
"What, are you going like that?"

00:01:40.770 --> 00:01:43.022
And I was like, "What the
heck is wrong with me?"

00:01:43.022 --> 00:01:44.940
(audience and Eugene laughing)

00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:45.840
All my friends were there.

00:01:45.840 --> 00:01:47.370
I went just like that,

00:01:47.370 --> 00:01:48.810
I'll have you know.
- [Gina] Good, good.

00:01:48.810 --> 00:01:50.610
- You did not bully me into changing.

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:52.328
- Yes, they're brutal,

00:01:52.328 --> 00:01:53.522
- [Kelly] (chuckles)

00:01:53.522 --> 00:01:54.355
- they are brutal.
- Look, I'm gonna hold onto

00:01:54.355 --> 00:01:56.243
it though, at least they're
looking at me paying attention.

